/T (Russia has significantly intensified its use of ballistic missiles in 2026, at a time when Ukraine faces shortages of interceptors such as U.S.-made Patriot missiles. According to monitoring data, since the beginning of 2026, Russia has launched more than 500 ballistic missiles.)
