/Title (Its ballistic arsenal is also being reinforced through increasingly close military cooperation with Pyongyang: a renewed use of North Korean KN-23 missiles has been documented starting at the end of July, while in August, Moscow has reportedly begun deploying a North Korean missile unit with six launchers and 120 ballistic missiles. Together, domestic production and North Korean supplies could allow Russia to maintain high rates of ballistic missile use even as existing stockpiles are depleted.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 830 0 R
/Prev 897 0 R
>>
