/Title (TI documentation identifies HT14 as the part marking used for several package variants of the SN74HCT14, a six-channel Schmitt-trigger inverter. The device converts input signals into clean digital logic outputs and is particularly useful for handling slow or noisy signal transitions.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 833 0 R
/Prev 904 0 R
/Next 915 0 R
>>
