/Title (Similarly, HT573 is the documented part marking for several variants of the SN74HCT573, an eight-bit transparent D-type latch with three-state outputs. It provides temporary storage and controlled transfer of digital data and can interface with shared data buses.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 833 0 R
/Prev 914 0 R
/Next 905 0 R
>>
