/Title (It combines several guidance and navigation methods. During its flight, the missile primarily relies on an inertial navigation system \(INS\), which can be supplemented by satellite navigation. In the terminal phase, an optical correlation seeker can be used to guide the missile toward its target.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 910 0 R
/Prev 916 0 R
/Next 933 0 R
>>
endobj
924 0 obj
<<
