/Title (The United States alone accounts for 13 microelectronics manufacturers identified. Combined with the country-level breakdown, this suggests that the system's dependence is not limited to a single U.S. manufacturer or component category.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 927 0 R
/Next 946 0 R
>>
endobj
937 0 obj
<<
/Title (Components of Swiss and Taiwanese origin are also present. TRACO Power DC/DC converters represent Switzerland, while the Taiwanese component base includes products from two manufacturers: a Vortex86DX-based x86-compatible system-on-chip from DM&P Electronics and flash memory manufactured by Winbond.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 927 0 R
/Prev 946 0 R
>>
